Pantum printer driver, repackaged from the vendor's official
pantum_7.4.170-1+1nfs1+sv_amd64.deb release.

The vendor binary is copyright (c) Zhuhai Pantum Electronics Co., Ltd
and is redistributed here unmodified apart from relocation, stripping
and the addition of RUNPATH entries to the vendor's own helper
binaries. See /usr/share/licenses/pantum/LICENSE.
